        `seniority item` "36(א)" "unpaid leave for which the employee paid 18.5% of salary to buy rights (the Civil Service notice of 15.6.92 applied to teachers paid by government ministries); or an unpaid-leave year, not through the training funds, in which pension rights are bought in a recognised fund" `in force` FALSE,
